flowchart LR
    Input[Seeded or imported daily sales] --> Validate[Validate and fill missing days with zero]
    Validate --> Split[Earlier 80 percent train - later 20 percent holdout]
    Split --> Models[Random Forest and seasonal-naive baseline]
    Models --> Evaluate[Fixed-origin recursive holdout MAE and RMSE]
    Evaluate --> Select[Select model by holdout MAE]
    Select --> Refit[Refit using all eligible history]
    Refit --> Future[Forecast tomorrow onward for 1 to 30 days]
    Future --> Range[Illustrative error ranges]
    Future --> Replenish[Demand plus safety minus available stock]
    Replenish --> Human[Human review - no purchase order automation]
